A hosted quote's first-block plus attaches any non-list block at column zero

```
> - > +
# h
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote><p>+</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<section id="h">
  <h1>h</h1>
</section>
```

```
> - > +
| c |
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote><p>+</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
> - a
> - > +
# h
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a</li>
    <li>
      <blockquote><p>+</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<section id="h">
  <h1>h</h1>
</section>
```
